    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Abiya Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋikanikauni ipukat erwosit Yeroboam Isirael, kisyakini Abiya akipuka Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋiuni. Arae ekiro a toto keŋ Mikaia nakoku a Uriel a ŋolo alo Gibea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, aremosi Abiya ka Yeroboam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Abiya tolot lojie ka ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋamiae ŋaomwon ŋulu apedorito ejie, kicodo Yeroboam daŋ lojie ka ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋamiae ŋakanikauni ŋulu apedorito ejie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towo Abiya alosyep a ekamukumukut a ŋolo enyaritae Semaraim, a ŋolo eyai nakwap ŋina a Epuraim ŋina a ŋikamukumukui. Tema Abiya neni a Yeroboam, “Kiirasi ŋakiro kaŋ, iyoŋ Yeroboam ka Ŋisirael daadaŋ! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyiyenete mono iyes atemar adau Ekapolon Akuj a Isirael anacamunet keŋ a ŋina ajik ainakin arwosiyo a Isirael neni a Daudi ka ŋipapae keŋ ŋikaru ka ŋikaru a? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Yeroboam lokoku a Nebat ŋolo arae epei alokapolok a ŋulu ewuapito Solomon lokoku a Daudi toŋer ekapolon keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeroboam tocunak ŋasyaanisya ŋace ŋuna koŋinae, toloto toŋero Reoboam lokoku a Solomon apaki ŋina ariŋaakar edit emam ŋuna ayeni akitepegia ikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tokona icamito iyes akitijiore apukan ŋina abu Ekapolon inak neni a ŋiletok a Daudi. Kire irae iyes ajore ŋina alalan nooi, ido iyakatar ŋitorubei a ŋitak a ŋulu itiyaunitae a egolid, ŋulu abu Yeroboam kitiyau erae ŋakujo kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa mono ipotu iyes kiritasi ŋisacaradotin ŋulu ke Ekapolon, ŋidwe ka Aron ŋulusapa kaapei ka ŋilepi, ido toseut ŋisacaradotin kus a ŋikulepek lopite ŋolo itiyaata ŋakwapin ŋunace a? Ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini eyauni imoŋ, kori ŋimeesekin ŋikanikaarei, epedoryo akituruwor esacaradoti a ŋakujo kus a ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani eruwor isua, Ekapolon iŋes erae Akuj kosi, nyimyekina isua iŋes. Ikiyakar isua ŋisacaradotin ŋulu itiyaete etic ke Ekapolon, ikes ŋiletok ka Aron, ido iŋarakinito ŋilepi ikes akitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Einanakinete ikes Ekapolon a ŋinataparacu ka a ŋinataboŋ ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ka icunyete ekinyate. Iwuanakinete ŋamugati lomesa ŋolo asegan ŋolo ke etal ka inokanakinete ŋitaae a ŋinataboŋ anawoeta a ŋitaae aŋuna itiyaunitae ke egolid. Iwuapitae isua ŋuna ikicik Ekapolon Akuj kosi, nai imyekis iyes iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikirukit isua ka Akuj; iŋes erae ekarikon kosi, eyakatar ŋisacaradotin keŋ ŋarupepe ŋuna ekutakinio anyaraunia ŋituŋa potu akitijiore iyes. Okoe iyes Ŋisirael, nyitijiyoto Ekapolon Akuj atapapaa kus, anerae nyilounete iyes.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋina erworor Abiya ŋin, kebu Yeroboam kiyakiya ŋasigarya keŋ ŋace tomanasi yaye ŋasigarya ka Abiya, kidoŋo ŋuluce kiŋaren ŋasigarya a Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eŋoleŋolekinete ŋasigarya a Yudaya, kiŋolikis kirikaun ikes alokaku ka alokiŋaren. Apotu nai ikes kikalout neni ke Ekapolon, tokutakis ŋisacaradotin ŋarupepe kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tocelut nai nooi ŋasigarya a Yudaya, apaki ŋin ŋina aceluniata ikes nooi, abu Akuj tobwaŋ Yeroboam ka Ŋisirael daadaŋ alokiŋaren Abiya ka ŋasigarya a Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋisirael tobwaŋas alokiŋaren ŋasigarya a Yudaya, inak Akuj ŋasigarya a Yudaya akiloun Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Abiya ka ŋasigarya keŋ toara nooi Ŋisirael, toarae ŋulu arae ŋarwonita ŋuna ajiok ŋalipyo ŋamiae ŋakan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋasigarya a Yudaya toreut Ŋisirael apaki ŋin, anerae ekinyomito ŋasigarya a Yudaya Ekapolon Akuj atapapaa kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Abiya ka ŋasigarya keŋ kiwuapa ŋasigarya a Yeroboam, kikamasi ŋitaunio kec lu ŋice: Besel ka ŋirerya ŋulu edunyatar, Yesana ka ŋirerya ŋulu edunyatar, Epuron ka ŋirerya ŋulu edunyatar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeroboam nyeryamu agogoŋu ace jik ŋinakitijikinet Abiya ŋikaru ŋuluce daadaŋ ŋulu epukator Abiya Yudaya. Ekaku, abu Ekapolon kitedyakak Yeroboam totwan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Abiya togogoŋior nooi alokipukae keŋ. Abu kiit ŋaberu ŋatomon ka ŋaomwon, touru ŋidwe ŋulusapa ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiarei ka ŋulupesur ŋitomon ka ŋikanikapei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo ka Abiya ŋuluce daadaŋ ka ŋipitesyo keŋ, igiritae loemut ŋolo a Ido a ekadwaran.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
